message: "Please cite this manuscript using the organizational citation identity below."
title: "Sets of flags with no common opposite in finite projective planes"
authors:
  - name: DannyExperiments
type: article
repository-code: "https://github.com/DannyExperiments/projective-plane-flags-no-common-opposite"
abstract: "Every finite projective plane of order s at least three has a set of s+1 incident flags without a common opposite and with noncollinear point entries and nonconcurrent line entries. For PG(2,q) with q at least three, the construction classifies all such sets."
keywords:
  - projective planes
  - flags
  - opposition
  - nuclei
